        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "A smaller number of foreign jurisdictions in which we operate have adopted laws enabling the government to suspend ISP services in the country.",
        "start_character": 74694,
        "end_character": 74837
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-248290",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-248290-a15905d6bb3028dd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-248290",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of March 31, 2026, we provided Ka-band communication services to approximately 13,200 vessels.",
        "start_character": 6523,
        "end_character": 6620
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-248290",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-248290-a15905d6bb3028dd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-248290",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Certain equipment that we manufacture must comply with applicable technical requirements intended to minimize radio interference to other communications services and ensure product safety.",
        "start_character": 75812,
        "end_character": 76000
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-248290",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-248290-a15905d6bb3028dd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-248290",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Certain of our services may constitute the provision of telecommunications to, from, or within the United States, and we are required to contribute a percentage of our revenues from such services to universal service support mechanisms that subsidize the provision of services to low-income consumers, high-cost areas, schools, libraries, and rural health care providers.",
        "start_character": 64934,
        "end_character": 65305
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-248290",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-248290-a15905d6bb3028dd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-248290",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, in addition to IFC terminals and our award-winning IFC services, we offer aviation customers complementary service offerings such as wireless in-flight entertainment (W-IFE) and other digital services, encryption and monetization solutions and integrated cockpit and safety software services.",
        "start_character": 14367,
        "end_character": 14672
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-248290",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-248290-a15905d6bb3028dd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-248290",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, as of March 31, 2026, we had eight additional GEO satellites under development or in preparation for launch: a high-capacity Ka-band GEO satellite (ViaSat-3 F3), three adaptive Ka-band GEO satellites (GX7, GX8 and GX9) and four Inmarsat-8 L-band GEO safety service satellites.",
        "start_character": 3979,
        "end_character": 4268
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-248290",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-248290-a15905d6bb3028dd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-248290",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If the deployment of new terrestrial or satellite networks results in harmful interference into our satellite operations, or if the implementation of those networks under newly adopted terms and conditions constrains or prohibits the types of spectrum uses for which we have planned in a manner that we do not anticipate, such developments could have a material adverse effect on our business, financial condition, and results of operations.",
        "start_character": 61773,
        "end_character": 62214
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-248290",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-248290-a15905d6bb3028dd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-248290",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to our sales force, we maintain a highly-trained service staff to provide technical product and service support to our customers.",
        "start_character": 45385,
        "end_character": 45526
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-248290",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-248290-a15905d6bb3028dd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-248290",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In particular, we provide a number of services that rely on the use of radio-frequency (RF) spectrum, and the provision of such services is highly regulated.",
        "start_character": 56639,
        "end_character": 56796
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-248290",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-248290-a15905d6bb3028dd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-248290",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Many of our competitors are also substantially larger than we are, may have greater brand recognition, substantial capital resources or more extensive engineering, manufacturing and marketing capabilities than we do, may have access to spectrum or technologies not available to us, or may be able to offer bundled service offerings that we are not able to replicate.",
        "start_character": 52725,
        "end_character": 53091
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-248290",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-248290-a15905d6bb3028dd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-248290",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Similarly, in addition to high-quality broadband connectivity services and terminals, we offer our maritime customers comprehensive software-defined managed services (such as critical safety communications capabilities, security, IoT integration and crew welfare solutions).",
        "start_character": 14673,
        "end_character": 14947
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-248290",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-248290-a15905d6bb3028dd",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-248290",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The degree to which we employ contract manufacturing depends on the maturity of the product and the forecasted production life cycle.",
        "start_character": 54962,
        "end_character": 55095
      }
